pan></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Treasure of Crystal Cove</a></b>, Turn in various ingredients at <a href=\"/page/Euphonia%27s_Barter_Box\" title=\"Euphonia&#39;s Barter Box\">Euphonia's Barter Box</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +9</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +9</a></b>: This item gives the wearer the power of Ogre Strength, granting a +9 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Strength.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spike-Studded\" title=\"Spike-Studded\">Spike-Studded</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spike-Studded\" title=\"Spike-Studded\">Spike-Studded</a>:</b> This item is reinforced with metal studs that improve your unarmed strikes. Your unarmed attacks do an additional 1 to 4 piercing damage.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Glass_Jaw_Strike\" title=\"Glass Jaw Strike\">Glass Jaw Strike</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Glass_Jaw_Strike\" title=\"Glass Jaw Strike\">Glass Jaw Strike</a>:</b> While wearing this item, when you roll a 20 on an unarmed attack, you will deal a tremendous blow to your target that will daze it (as the <a href=\"/page/Sap\" title=\"Sap\">Sap</a> ability) and may knock it down as well.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Deception\" title=\"Deception\"> Deception +7</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Deception\" title=\"Deception\"> Deception +7</a>:</b> +7 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to hit and +11 to damage for any hit that would qualify as a sneak attack.</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-de